WEBVTT

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:09.940
A girl appeared, shrouded in mystery and bound by chains to a Relic.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.820
Shadows began to move, seeking it.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.020
The Gadgets dance in the sky, along with a mistress of illusion.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.600
The summoner appeared underground along with her companions.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:28.700
All of us have the power to stand against them.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.020
To protect them

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.620
so they may fight without hesistation.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:39.160
Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha StrikerS<i>
will now begin.</i>

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:56.420
How’s this?

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:01.670
Tia, what should we do?

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:04.060
Our mission is to retrieve the case.

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.680
We’ll fall back and draw them in.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:09.240
Lt. Vita and Command Sergeant Major Rein are on their way.

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:12.740
If we can hook up with them,
we may be able to stop them.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:13.580
Right?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:14.760
Okay.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:15.400
Alright.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:18.110
That sounds good, Subaru, Teana.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.710
Lt. Vita!

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.290
I’m here too.

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:25.890
Both of you read the situation appropriately. Nice decision!

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:29.580
Lieutenant, Command Sergeant Major Rein, where are you?

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:33.330
Lulu, something’s coming.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:35.620
The mana signature is huge!

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:37.820
Eisen!

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.730
Giant Form

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:42.340
Rein, let’s charge in!

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:43.210
Okie-doke!

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.560
Grab them in a frozen hold.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.940
<b>Freezing Fetters</b>

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.490
Take this!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.260
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:19.210
I’m glad you’re all safe.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:24.240
Your team is really strong, Lieutenant.

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:28.510
But is it okay for operatives of the Bureau to damage public facilities like this?

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:32.440
Well, this place has long been abandoned anyway...

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.260
Caro!

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:36.950
Erio.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.190
Fried.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.720
Crap.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.380
Same here.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.840
So they got away, huh?

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:55.390
What.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.090
I’m sensing a large-scale summoning.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.770
That’s probably the cause.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.090
Let’s get out of here!

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:01.960
Subaru!

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:02.800
Yes, ma’am!

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:05.320
<b>Wingroad</b>

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.070
Subaru, Ginga, take the lead!

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:12.990
I’ll fly up last.

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:13.810
Yes, ma’am!

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:16.440
Caro, here. Your hat.

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:18.950
Thank you very much.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:22.460
Hey, would you be able to seal the Relic for me?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.630
Yes, I can.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.330
I have an idea.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:27.360
Give me a hand.

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:28.620
Okay!

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.920
How many left?

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:48.430
You’ve knocked it down by nine—no, eight formations.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:51.880
We’ve started breaking down the illusion’s pattern.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.750
Incoming transmission from the observation team.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.150
Composite signal discrimination is proceeding as scheduled.

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:57.160
We’re almost there!

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.610
Great! You are the best operators Riot Force 6 could have.

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:03.170
Okay, let’s keep it going.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.880
Please take care of my targeting.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.050
Yes, ma’am!

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:09.010
What is it?

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:11.120
What’s going on here?

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:13.120
This is real-time footage of the Main Office’s

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:17.040
antiquities investigation group, Riot Force 6.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:22.920
What you’re seeing destroyed here are the reported A.M.F.-equipped U.F.O.s.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:29.700
The one performing the shooting is most likely the commander of Riot Force 6, a SS rank mage.

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:32.520
A SS rank mage in the Ground Armed Service?

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:33.870
I haven’t heard of this.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:36.100
She’s attached to the Main Office itself.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.930
Who is this commander,
and who are her supporters?

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:40.100
Her chief supporters are

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:44.300
Admiral Chrono Harlaown of the Main Office’s Dimensional Navy

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.450
and Director-General Lindy Harlaown,

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:51.890
as well as Knight Carim Gracia from the Church of the Holy King.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.490
A bunch of amateurs who think they’re heroes.

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:58.500
The unit’s commander is Lt. Colonel Hayate Yagami.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.680
Hayate Yagami!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.480
<i>That</i> Hayate Yagami?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.940
Yes, sir.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.250
The Hayate Yagami from the Book of Darkness Incident.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:13.230
The ward of Gil Graham, the man who was behind that attempted medium-scale dimensional incident.

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:15.980
Both of them are criminals!

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:20.360
Lt. Colonel Yagami’s suspended sentence
has long since been expunged,

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:24.060
and the incident with Admiral Graham
was overlooked.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:24.850
So then—

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:26.060
Irrelevant!

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:28.230
Once you’ve committed a crime, it doesn’t just go away.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:32.310
That is a dangerous remark.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.980
I’ll ask you not to announce that in public.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.180
I know.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:39.510
How annoying! The Navy is always like that.

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:41.980
It continually underestimates dangerous elements.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.680
Lt. General, for two years you have continually denied the Ground Armed Service’s requests

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:50.060
for funds devoted to develop countermeasures for A.M.F. weapons.

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:52.410
So it’s quite likely that the Main Office and the Church of the Holy King

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.660
created them as an independent means of dealing with the problem.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:00.780
Sometime soon, I want you to go investigate them.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:06.560
If you find any problems, any at all, I’m going to see her dragged in front of a committee.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:07.650
Sir!

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:12.930
She may provide an excellent means of attacking that impotent Church.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.100
Understood, sir.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.640
You can’t, Lulu.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.070
This is a bad idea.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.150
How are we going to find the case in the rubble?

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:38.860
Even if they’re Bureau staff,
they might get crushed and die!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:43.980
If they’re that powerful,
I doubt this is enough to kill them.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:48.110
I’ll have Quattro and Sein find the case for me.

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:49.910
That’s not a good idea, Lulu.

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:54.160
You need to stay away from the Numbers and that twisted doctor.

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:56.140
Sir Zest told you that too, didn’t he?

00:08:56.140 --> 00:09:02.750
They say a lot of things, but in the end we’re nothing but guinea pigs to them—

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.050
He did it.

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:12.320
Galue, are you okay?

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.210
You may go back.

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:18.570
Agito is here.

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:25.360
You too, Jirai-Oh.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.200
What the...?

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.970
This is the end of the line.

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:25.560
Dammit!

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:35.060
I don’t like this. It’s like I’m beating up a little kid.

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:39.140
You’re under arrest for using dangerous magic inside city limits

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:41.550
and for obstruction of justice.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:55.260
Dieci, can you see it?

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:56.420
Yup.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:59.880
There’s nothing in the way, and the air is clear.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:02.130
I can see it clearly.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:11.620
But are you sure it’s okay to fire, Quattro?

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:16.320
The case will probably be fine,
but it’ll destroy the material.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:22.260
According to Uno and the Doctor,
if that material really is the right one...

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:29.080
If it really is the Vessel of the Holy King, then cannon fire won’t kill it. It’s okay.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:42.210
Quattro. Miss Lutecia and Agito were captured.

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:46.790
Is that right?
That mini-knight caught them, did she?

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:49.910
Sein is keeping an eye on them right now.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.860
Should I give her a hand?

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:52.890
If you please.

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:54.860
Sein?

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:57.110
Hey there, Quatty!

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.170
I’ll give you your orders.

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:01.900
Do as your big sister says, okay?

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.640
Hmmm... roger.

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.490
Hi, Miss Lu!

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:19.700
Quattro.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.720
Seems like you’re in a pinch.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:25.630
If you’d like, I’ll give you a hand.

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:27.180
Yes, please.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.100
Okay!

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:36.420
Then, Miss, would you give my message to that red knight?

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:40.460
I can see it.

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.150
Thank goodness! The helicopter is safe.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:48.200
I’ve spotted an energy signal inside the city!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.640
It’s enormous!

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:52.000
No... that can’t be right!

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:02.280
I’m seeing a cannon charge,
physical destruction-type. Estimated at S rank!

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.730
Inherent Skill:

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:07.660
executing Heavy Barrel.

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:09.970
You can capture me if you want,

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.390
You can capture me if you want,

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:17.730
but can you really leave that helicopter of yours alone?

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.830
Twelve seconds remaining.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:22.870
Eleven.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:23.570
Ten.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.460
Oh, Miss?

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:27.740
Can I add more more thing?

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.500
You might not be able to

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:34.680
to protect them again.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:37.350
Fire!

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:08.100
The cannon struck the helicopter directly.

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:10.590
That’s impossible. Give me a sitrep!

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.700
There’s too much interference!
I can’t get any data!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:14.970
No...!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:19.510
Sgt. Vice and Dr. Shamal!

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:20.800
Why you...!

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.230
L-Lieutenant, calm down!

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:24.530
Shut up!

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.460
You have people working with you, right?

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:27.470
Where are they?

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.490
Tell me!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.780
Erio, there’s something under you!

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:40.480
I’ll be taking this.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:46.130
Crap!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:53.760
Miss Lu, this is Number VI, Sein.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:57.280
I’ll save you with my I.S., Deep Diver.

00:14:57.280 --> 00:15:01.220
Turn your field and barrier off and stay right there, okay?

00:15:06.160 --> 00:15:07.060
Hold it!

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:11.720
Where’s Agito?

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:15.300
Agito ran away just then.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.030
Good work, really.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.390
Uh... we’ve lost them.

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:25.820
Crap!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:29.730
Long Arch, is the helicopter all right?

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:32.570
It hasn’t been shot down, has it?

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:37.610
A perfect plan, wouldn’t you agree?

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:38.520
Quiet.

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.580
I’m confirming my kill.

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.000
What?

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.420
It’s still in the air!

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:52.700
Stars 2 and Long Arch,

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:57.860
This is Stars 1. I was just close enough to save the helicopter.

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:00.500
That was close.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.520
Too close.

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:03.210
Limiter released!

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:06.320
Nanoha’s and Raising Heart’s Exceed Mode!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.640
Oh my.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:10.920
Even if that’s not our full power,
you’ve got to be kidding me.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:18.140
I’ve found you.

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:20.090
Here too?

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:20.870
She’s fast!

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.410
Stop!

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:29.860
You’re under arrest for attempted murder and the use of dangerous magic inside city limits.

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:33.010
Not today!

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:34.900
Execute I.S.

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:36.910
<b>Silver Curtain</b>

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:39.490
Hayate!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.080
Position confirmed.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.840
Preparation complete.

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:46.360
Four seconds until execution.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.590
Roger.

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:51.080
She turned around?

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:51.990
Why?

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:54.240
It can’t—

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.600
A wide-area spatial attack!

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:00.700
No way!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:04.250
In a distant land, sink into the darkness.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.480
<b>Diabolic Emission</b>

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:24.350
They won’t surrender...

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:26.710
Flight risk confirmed.

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.400
Knock them out via Buster,

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:40.300
and take them into custody.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:46.450
Dieci, Quattro!

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:47.330
Stay still.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.210
Execute I.S.

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.230
<b>Ride Impulse</b>

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:55.140
<b>Trident...</b>

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.010
<b>...Smasher</b>

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:02.500
<b>Excelion...</b>

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.890
<b>...Buster</b>

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:15.600
Bingo!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:17.390
No, they dodged it!

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:20.770
They were rescued at the last second.

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:22.250
Alto, track them.

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:23.790
Yes, ma’am.

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:35.620
Tre, thanks for the help.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:37.800
Thanks.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.520
Don’t just sit there.

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.760
Stand up.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.960
I’m surrounded by idiots.

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:46.440
I was just here to keep an eye on you,
but I’m glad I came.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:50.710
Sein has already finished recovering the girl and the case.

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:53.150
We’ll meet up with them and return.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:56.270
We lost the signal.

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:59.070
The abnormal signal is gone too.

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:01.870
They got away, huh?

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.810
Yeah. Sorry.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:05.400
We’ve totally failed here.

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:10.720
The summoner got away,
and they took the case too.

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:12.460
We can’t track them either.

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:13.860
We failed.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:16.400
Um, Lt. Vita?

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:21.590
Yes. The forwards did their best.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:24.490
This was totally my failure.

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.820
Mine too.

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:27.700
Lieutenant, uh...!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:30.040
What is it? I’m in the middle of my report!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:35.970
Well, you see... there was so much tension that we really didn’t have time to say it, but...

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:40.200
We sort of did a little something with the Relic.

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:48.950
We’re finally back.

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:52.080
It’s thanks to your mass teleportation spell, Miss.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.410
Thank you very much.

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:56.750
Oh, Sein!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:58.600
Take a look in the case.

00:19:58.600 --> 00:19:59.300
Okie-dokie!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:10.900
Ta-daa!

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:14.480
It’s empty?

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.300
What’s going on!

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:17.840
Sein?

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:19.090
You couldn’t have—

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:21.400
I retrieved it perfectly!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:25.800
You didn’t screw up Deep Diver and drop the contents, did you?

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.240
I did not!

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:34.540
I scanned it and confirmed that it was the real case!

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:35.550
See?

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:40.130
Well, the case certainly is the real thing.

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:47.170
That’s strange, isn’t it?

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:48.130
You idiots!

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.920
Are you blind?

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:53.870
Here!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:58.330
The case wasn’t a silhouette... it was real.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:03.700
My silhouettes are weak to shock,
and they would have found out when they took it.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:09.830
So we opened the case and then put a heavy seal on the Relic itself.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:11.620
So, the Relic...

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.790
Like this.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:22.300
We thought we’d have Caro hold it since she has the least direct contact with the enemy.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:25.010
I see!

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:34.540
Seems there’s no need for us to do anything.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:36.880
The mission was completed successfully.

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:39.110
Let’s be happy for it.

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.070
We were tricked.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.090
I’m sorry, Miss.

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:45.640
It was a foolish mistake.

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:47.100
I don’t care.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:51.970
The only thing I’m looking for is the Serial No. XI core.

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.540
This is No. VI.

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.500
But this is bad.

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:01.340
If the core and the material
fell into the hands of the Bureau,

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:03.930
Uno will be mad at us!

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:05.870
What a pain!

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:21.880
We finished the examination.

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:26.560
There don’t seem to be any real problems,
so I’ll be heading back.

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:27.990
Roger.

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:30.340
How about the forwards?

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:31.720
All of them are fine.

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:35.200
Erio’s and Caro’s wounds were pretty minor.

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:38.420
They’ve probably finished
their reports and are in their quarters.

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:39.680
I see.

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:46.110
I need to get back and write a report myself.

00:22:46.110 --> 00:22:48.690
I think this one’s going to be pretty long.

00:22:48.690 --> 00:22:49.550
It’s all right.

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:52.010
I have the documents and data ready for you.

00:22:53.330 --> 00:22:54.580
Thanks.

00:23:01.140 --> 00:23:02.340
Mama...

00:23:09.850 --> 00:23:11.280
Everything’s fine.

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:13.650
I’m right here.

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:14.740
Don’t be scared.

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:16.700
Mama...

00:25:17.540 --> 00:25:19.410
Lives created.

00:25:19.410 --> 00:25:21.160
Lives saved.

00:25:21.160 --> 00:25:23.220
Each longs for something different,

00:25:23.220 --> 00:25:25.790
for what their hearts are set on.

00:25:32.380 --> 00:25:34.740
It was only a small wish.
